      "instance_name": "steve_harvey",
      "label": "Steve Harvey",
      "description": "A well-known American comedian, television host, and actor. He is widely recognized for his distinctive appearance (bald, mustache) and his comedic style, often involving exaggerated expressions and physical humor. His image is frequently used in memes for its expressive facial reactions.",
