      "description": "A meme format that uses the image of Steve Harvey smiling broadly while seated at a panel, overlaid with text that humorously describes being 'put in fb jail' but not sweating because of a backup account. The scene relies on the contrast between the cheerful expression and the implied frustration of being banned from Facebook.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
