      "description": "The meme is designed for users of Facebook and other social media platforms who are familiar with the concept of account suspension ('fb jail') and may have backup accounts. The humor relies on shared digital experiences and platform-specific jargon, making it relatable to those who use social media regularly and understand the implications of being banned.",
